</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<div style="text-align: center;">Use the Jackson County<br />
<strong><a href="http://jacksoncomo.maps.arcgis.com/apps/webappviewer/index.html?id=00aea7b613ee4421b4d37fa2d71c06c9" target="_self">Legislative Maps Application</a></strong><br />
to find out who represents you<br />
on the County Legislature</div>
