<h2>Step 2</h2>
<div class="oc-wysiwyg-container-panel-content">
<p>After the "Search result" box pops up, you will need to click on the map in the area immediately outside this pop-up box.</p>
<div><img alt="3689.jpeg" src="/files/sharedassets/public/v/1/county-legislature/images/3689.jpeg" /></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="oc-wysiwyg-container-panel">
<h2>Step 3</h2>
<div class="oc-wysiwyg-container-panel-content">
<p>After you click&nbsp;on the map (Step 2), the "Search result" box will be replaced by a new pop-up that you will show in which Legislative districts you live and who are the Legislators for each of the dis</p>
<div><img alt="3687.gif" src="/files/sharedassets/public/v/1/county-legislature/images/3687.gif" /></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>


      
